  str_n27_difflevel_intro_head_1 = "Dire Straits Mode",
  str_n27_difflevel_intro_body_1 = "1. There are 3 waypoints in Dire Straits mode. Each waypoint consists of 2-3 stages. There is no sequential connection between these stages, so you can challenge any waypoint stage you want.\n2. Each waypoint has 3–5 Challenge Trophies. Clear stages using team formations that adhere to the conditions outlined by the Trophies to obtain corresponding rewards.\n3. When challenging stages in the same waypoint, you are required to use different Aurorians.",
