  str_n27_15_name = "ST3 - Nuptials",
  str_n27_1_name_desc = "—",
  str_n27_2_name_desc = "A chaotic wedding causes a dilemma for you, and the bride Tara is apparently suffering from amnesia.",
  str_n27_3_name_desc = "After arriving at Lumopolis, Naroxel gives the couple a special task before awarding them her seal of approval—to help the Courier Union sell limited-edition stamps for Mooncrown Day.",
  str_n27_4_name_desc = "You go to Umbraton with Adonis for some rest and relaxation but inadvertently learn that Black Umbrella Laboratories in Illumina might be able to examine Tara and her condition.",
  str_n27_5_name_desc = "After arriving in Illumina, you run into Dove in Gannon City. She promises that as long as you help her to deliver her backlog of shipments, she'll award the couple a seal.",
  str_n27_6_name_desc = "In the Black Umbrella Laboratories, Jola tells you that he could try making an antidote if he had the scales of the rare sandworm. But, Adonis thinks he stands no chance against such a creature.",
  str_n27_7_name_desc = "Jeriah calls Sable and Adonis over for battle training, but neither dares to attack.",
  str_n27_8_name_desc = "Sable's identity is almost exposed in Gannon City. Kya promises her that she will get her home.",
  str_n27_9_name_desc = "—",
  str_n27_10_name_desc = "Early the next day, you pack your things and prepare to set off to find the rare pink sandworm.",
  str_n27_11_name_desc = "Just after you finish eating, another group of Eclipsites shows up. The appearance of so many Eclipsites puts Jeriah on edge.",
  str_n27_12_name_desc = "The pink sandworm is extremely cunning. It uses the advantages of its native terrain to separate everyone and put you all in danger...",
  str_n27_13_name_desc = "You set out toward the pink sandworm-infested oasis in Jeriah's vehicle, hoping that no harm has come to Kya and the others...",
  str_n27_14_name_desc = "Adonis and Kya are okay, but where is Sable?",
  str_n27_15_name_desc = "—",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_1 = "As Mooncrown Day approaches, Naroxel entrusts you with a special errand: to escort her friend's fiancée from the Rediesel Desert to Northland. She is accompanied by a senior member of the Courier Union's Rediesel Wrench division named Jeriah. You set off immediately, but things don't go so smoothly.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_2 = "Inspired by Jeriah's words, Tara decides to test Adonis's sincerity by faking amnesia. After failing to find the antidote, an all-purpose psychological potion, Adonis listens to Jeriah's suggestion and takes Tara to participate in the Courier Union Crown Moon Day festivities all over the continent.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_3 = "After arriving in Lumopolis, Naroxel asks the couple to complete the seal test in a relatively sweet and heartwarming way—by selling Crown Moon Day stamps, and she hopes that you and Jeriah will continue to help them. But even if the seal test is completed, it may not be enough to bridge the gap between them.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_4 = "You take Adonis to relax in Umbraton, but become entangled in a caper with Hachi and Gin. After getting rid of them, you learn from Dina that you might be able to go to Black Umbrella Laboratories to check on Tara's condition for yourself.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_5 = "You catch Dove hiding in the union office, slacking off from work. She casually says that she'll stamp the seal as long as you help with her backlog of orders. You and your party begin helping Dove deliver letters, while Kya takes Sable to look for clues regarding her memory in Gannon City.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_6 = "You head to Black Umbrella Laboratories, where Jola tells you that he might be able to make an antidote if only he had the scales of a rare sandworm. Adonis despairs at the thought but is not ready to give up. Jeriah believes that the perfect place to start would be by honing his courage.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_7 = "Adonis and Sable begin sparring but reach an impasse. Adonis becomes riled up by Jeriah's provocation, which makes him summon up the courage to attack. This attack appears to conjure memories of the desert in Sable's mind. However, Jeriah has already perceived Sable's true identity, and confronts Kya.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_8 = "Kya takes Sable to buy food, but Sable faints because of her surging memories, nearly exposing her identity. Kya takes her away to escape from the crowd. When Sable awakens, she remembers that she was once an Aurorian, deceived by her beloved, and her home seems to have been somewhere in the Rediesel Desert.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_9 = "You return to the Rediesel Wrench branch of the Courier Union, planning to recuperate here overnight and start again. Jeriah goes to check on the condition of the vehicles and pack up the equipment while Tara drags Adonis away to put up a bonfire and prepare a Rediesel Wrench-style meal.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_10 = "The next morning, you pack up your equipment and prepare to leave. However, Adonis says he didn't get much sleep thanks to the spicy lizard jerky he ate the previous night. All he can do now is try to keep his spirits up and follow behind, but is he really okay?",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_11 = "After defeating two groups of Eclipsites in succession, the astute Jeriah notices something unusual—these Eclipsites are not fighting at all. In fact, it is more like they are running for their lives! Just then, the reason the Eclipsites are running around in such a frenzy finally shows itself. It is the rare pink sandworm!",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_12 = "You are locked into an arduous battle with the pink sandworm. Finally, the sandworm uses its cunning to escape, raising a dust cloud and carrying off Adonis, Kya, and Sable. Jeriah sends her Speaker to look for your lost companions, but cannot find them. Faced with this crisis, she finally decides to let down her guard and ask the people of the desert for help.",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_13 = "Jeriah drives you to the oasis where the pink sandworm dwells. Here, you find Adonis and Kya unconscious, but Sable, carried away by the sandworm, is nowhere to be found. When Adonis wakes up, Tara tells him the truth about her feigned amnesia...",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_14 = "In order to find Sable, Jeriah sends her Speaker out again. This time, the Speaker brings back traces of Sable. It turns out that Sable fought the pink sandworm to protect the two unconscious Aurorians, and her true identity is not that of Kya's relative...",
  str_n27_level_desc_long_15 = "After many unexpected twists and turns, Tara and Adonis finally get to know each other better, with Jeriah's help. They successfully pass the test and gain the approval of their families. In the end, they become a happy couple. You complete Naroxel's entrustment and receive her reward—now, it's time to return to Soroz.",
  str_n27_h1_name = "H1 - Blistering Speed",
  str_n27_h2_name = "H2 - Formation",
  str_n27_h3_name = "H3 - Intersection",
  str_n27_h4_name = "H4 - Severed",
  str_n27_h1_name_desc = "Faster! Faster! Speed is everything! Not only should we race down the road to the future at full speed, but we must also fight the enemies charging our way head-on!",
  str_n27_h2_name_desc = "It seems we'll have the help of friendly forces in this battle, and they seem to have taken up some kind of a military formation. Maybe we can use this?",
  str_n27_h3_name_desc = "Where the three sides intersect emerges a way to meet the enemy from three different flanks, but at the margins... a potential \"shortcut\" also presents itself.",
  str_n27_h4_name_desc = "The terrain is broken and the abyss surrounds... Though many enemies are unaffected by such conditions, fortunately, you have an ally who can overcome such complications...",
  str_n27_bh1_name = "EX1 - Ablaze",
